chpoints:\n    43→  - T1: \"cmd/sha256sum — SHA-256 digest computation, GNU format output, check mode, binary/tag flags (prd032-sha256sum R1, R2, R3)\"\n    44→  - T2: \"pkg/testutils — RunDiffTests, binary execution and byte-for-byte comparison\"\n    45→  - T3: \"pkg/sys — InstallSIGPIPEHandler for graceful SIGPIPE handling\"\n    46→\n    47→success_criteria:\n    48→  - id: S1\n    49→    criterion: cmd/sha256sum compiles and ./bin/sha256sum exists after mage build.\n    50→  - id: S2\n    51→    criterion: The differential test for digest computation passes; output matches gsha256sum byte-for-byte.\n    52→  - id: S3\n    53→    criterion: The differential test for --check on a valid file passes; exits 0 and prints OK lines.\n    54→  - id: S4\n    55→    criterion: The differential test for --check on a file with a mismatch passes; exits 1 and prints FAILED.\n    56→  - id: S5\n    57→    criterion: The differential test for --tag passes; BSD format output matches gsha256sum --tag.\n    58→\n    59→out_of_scope:\n    60→  - SHA-224 and SHA-256/224 truncations are not implemented.\n    61→\n    62→test_suite: test-rel05.4\n    63→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"51232ce4-c523-4362-91b9-8c0518fc2217","uuid":"fa5d0c8f-d94e-4a73-a21d-73d622d0c6f2","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/361/docs/specs/use-cases/rel05.4-uc003-sha256sum.yaml","content":"id: rel05.4-uc003-sha256sum\ntitle: \"Compute and verify SHA-256 digests via sha256sum\"\n\nsummary: |\n  The operator runs the Go sha256sum binary on one or more files or stdin. The binary\n  computes SHA-256 digests and prints them in GNU format, or verifies a checksum file.\n  The differential testing harness then runs both the Go binary and the Homebrew\n  reference binary (gsha256sum from coreutils) with identical inputs and confirms that\n  their outputs are identical byte-for-byte.\n\nactor: Human Operator